  "question": {
    "text": "If $A=\\left(\\begin{array}{cc}\\cos \\theta & -\\sin \\theta \\\\ \\sin \\theta & \\cos \\theta\\end{array}\\right)$ and $\\theta=\\frac{2 \\pi}{7}$, then $A^{100}=A \\times A \\times \\ldots .(100$ times $)$ is equal to",
